WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.240
The first film showed how Hedgehog turns off Patched so Smoothened keeps Gli whole.

2
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.520
In vertebrate cells, where does that switch actually sit?

3
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.500
And why can one Smoothened blocker both deform an embryo and shrink a skin tumour?

4
00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:22.363
Pull back from the plasma membrane to see that hair-like antenna.

5
00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.903
Most non-dividing vertebrate cells carry a single primary cilium.

6
00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:30.983
It does not beat like a motile whip.

7
00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:37.743
Motor shuttles called intraflagellar transport continuously build and maintain its

8
00:00:37.743 --> 00:00:38.843
microtubule core.

9
00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:44.353
In vertebrates, the Hedgehog switch runs inside this tiny compartment.

10
00:00:45.753 --> 00:00:50.453
Without Hedgehog, Patched sits along the ciliary membrane while Smoothened waits

11
00:00:50.453 --> 00:00:51.913
outside in the cell body.

12
00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:58.953
Meanwhile, trimming Gli, mainly the form called Gli3, into a repressor also depends

13
00:00:58.953 --> 00:01:03.453
on this cilium. Quiet cells actively silence target genes.

14
00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:07.767
When Hedgehog binds Patched, the traffic reverses.

15
00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:13.507
Patched exits the primary cilium, and Smoothened moves inside and switches on.

16
00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:20.107
Full-length Gli proteins gather at the ciliary tip, escape trimming, and travel to

17
00:01:20.107 --> 00:01:21.647
the nucleus as activators.

18
00:01:23.027 --> 00:01:26.547
Both sides of Gli processing therefore depend on the psyllium.

19
00:01:26.547 --> 00:01:27.007
Glee proteins gather at the ciliary tip, escape trimming, and travel to the nucleus

20
00:01:27.007 --> 00:01:27.550
as activators.

21
00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.930
Now trace the pathway as a chain of switches.

22
00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:36.110
Hedgehog turns off Patched, Patched holds back Smoothened, and Smoothened governs

23
00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.490
Gli inside the cilium.

24
00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:43.770
In a linear chain like this, a block or fault acting later overrides everything

25
00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.770
upstream of it.

26
00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:48.233
Watch that rule in an early vertebrate embryo.

27
00:01:49.673 --> 00:01:52.373
The forebrain starts with a single central eye field.

28
00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:58.453
Sonic hedgehog, a vertebrate Hedgehog, comes from the midline and switches on

29
00:01:58.453 --> 00:02:00.493
Smoothened to split that field in two.

30
00:02:01.813 --> 00:02:07.573
Now predict. The plant alkaloid cyclopamine locks Smoothened off while Sonic

31
00:02:07.573 --> 00:02:08.813
hedgehog still arrives.

32
00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:12.533
Will the eye field divide, or stay as one?

33
00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:20.747
It stays as a single central eye.

34
00:02:22.027 --> 00:02:26.387
Even though Hedgehog still turns off Patched, Smoothened sits downstream of both.

35
00:02:27.887 --> 00:02:30.907
Locking Smoothened off overrides the signal above it.

36
00:02:31.947 --> 00:02:34.527
Ewes grazing corn lily bore one-eyed lambs.

37
00:02:35.587 --> 00:02:40.127
The plant's cyclopamine later led researchers to Smoothened as a drug target.

38
00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:45.300
The same downstream rule explains a common human skin cancer.

39
00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:51.220
Most basal cell carcinomas lose Patched, leaving Smoothened running without

40
00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:55.860
Hedgehog. The drug vismodegib binds Smoothened and shuts it off.

41
00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:01.660
Because Smoothened acts downstream of Patched, blocking Smoothened silences the

42
00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:07.180
tumour pathway. But if a tumour's fault lies below Smoothened, vismodegib cannot

43
00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.180
stop it.

44
00:03:08.733 --> 00:03:12.013
Notice how location and order unite the whole story.

45
00:03:13.253 --> 00:03:18.133
The primary cilium gathers Patched, Smoothened, and Gli into one signalling hub.

46
00:03:19.493 --> 00:03:23.533
By contrast, most fly cells run this pathway without any cilium.

47
00:03:24.793 --> 00:03:28.293
Along that chain, downstream steps override upstream ones.

48
00:03:29.573 --> 00:03:33.993
In vertebrates, the cilium houses the switch, and downstream steps decide.
